sequenceDiagram
 participant O as Operator
 participant C as Control Plane
 participant V as Validator
 participant R as Repository
 participant N as Runtime Nodes
 O->>C: upload signed ZIP
 C->>V: validate/compile/test
 V-->>C: report
 O->>C: approve + activate
 C->>R: store immutable package
 C->>N: preload checksum
 N-->>C: ready
 C->>N: atomic activation epoch
